{%- liquid
  # Bundle price tokens. Lets template settings that cannot evaluate Liquid
  # (richtext, multicolumn column titles) carry computed per-product prices via
  # [[TOTAL]] / [[PRICE]] / [[SAVINGS]]. The total is SUMMED from the metafield,
  # never asserted. See docs/bundle-landing-architecture.md.
  # No-op when the tokens are absent, so every other template renders unchanged.
  assign bundle_total = 0
  assign bundle_price = 0
  assign bundle_savings = 0

  # Per-bundle copy. One template serves every bundle: the metaobject wins, the
  # section settings are the fallback so non-bundle uses of this section are
  # unaffected. See docs/bundle-landing-architecture.md.
  assign lander = product.metafields.bundle.lander.value
  assign hero_heading   = section.settings.heading_rte
  assign hero_sub       = section.settings.subheading_rte
  assign hero_cta       = section.settings.cta_label
  assign hero_rating    = section.settings.rating_caption
  assign lander_bullets = blank
  if lander != blank
    if lander.heading != blank
      capture hero_heading
        echo '<p>'
        echo lander.heading
        echo '</p>'
      endcapture
    endif
    if lander.subheading != blank
      capture hero_sub
        echo '<p>'
        echo lander.subheading
        echo '</p>'
      endcapture
    endif
    if lander.cta_label != blank
      assign hero_cta = lander.cta_label
    endif
    if lander.rating_caption != blank
      assign hero_rating = lander.rating_caption
    endif
    assign lander_bullets = lander.bullets.value
  endif
  if product != blank and product.metafields.bundle.value_stack.value != blank
    for bt_row in product.metafields.bundle.value_stack.value
      unless bt_row.digital
        assign bundle_total = bundle_total | plus: bt_row.amount
      endunless
    endfor
    assign bundle_price = product.price | divided_by: 100
    assign bundle_savings = bundle_total | minus: bundle_price
  endif
-%}
{% comment %}
  Reusable Landing Hero Section
  - Mobile-first, background image OR solid color
  - RTE headline & subheadline (subheadline can have its own background image)
  - Bullets & guarantees as repeatable blocks with preset/custom icons
  - Optional ratings row
  - Flip layout option
  - CTA scrolls to a configurable on-page anchor (default #buy-box)
  - CSS lives in assets/hero-landing-section.css
{% endcomment %}

{% assign section_id = section.id %}

{%- comment -%}
  Per-bundle hero override.

  templates/product.bundle-landing.json is one template shared by six bundles —
  the Coconut Reset, the 90-Day Clean Swap, Head-to-Toe, the Hand Soap Set, The
  Clean Swap and the Gift Box. section.settings.bg_image_* therefore resolves to
  a single image for all of them, so every one of those landers served the same
  generic hero no matter what its own gallery said.

  A product may now override it with metafields bundle.hero_desktop /
  bundle.hero_mobile (file_reference -> image). Unset, both fall through to the
  section setting, which is exactly the behaviour these landers had before this
  block existed — so adding it changes nothing until an image is attached.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign hero_d = product.metafields.bundle.hero_desktop.value | default: section.settings.bg_image_desktop -%}
{%- assign hero_m = product.metafields.bundle.hero_mobile.value | default: section.settings.bg_image_mobile -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Load section CSS RENDER-BLOCKING, on purpose.

  This used to be the media="print" onload="this.media='all'" trick. That made
  the hero paint before its own stylesheet applied: .hero-landing__bg is not yet
  position:absolute;inset:0 and .hero-landing__bg-img not yet
  height:100%;object-fit:cover, so the <img> below lays out in normal flow at
  its own width/height attributes -- which are the MOBILE image's (750x1000
  portrait on the homepage, 100x100 on the landing-page templates) while the
  desktop <source> serves 2400x1200 landscape. At a 1280px viewport that
  reserves ~1707px, then collapses to the 760px min-height when the sheet
  finally applies. Measured: homepage CLS p75 0.1231, 25 of 27
  hero-landing__bg shifts at vw >= 1200, median 0.141 at median 973ms.

  The preload on the next line already starts the fetch at the same moment, so
  making it blocking costs no extra latency -- and this is above-the-fold,
  LCP-critical CSS that should never have been deferred. The <noscript> copy is
  gone with the trick: it existed only to cover the JS-dependent onload swap.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="{{ 'hero-landing-section.css' | asset_url }}">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'hero-landing-section.css' | asset_url }}">

{%- comment -%} Preload likely LCP image for desktop {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if hero_d != blank -%}
  <link rel="preload" as="image"
        href="{{ hero_d | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
        imagesizes="100vw"
        imagesrcset="{{ hero_d | image_url: width: 2000 }} 2000w, {{ hero_d | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ hero_d | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w">
{%- endif -%}


<section
  id="hero-landing-{{ section_id }}"
  class="hero-landing
         {% if section.settings.flip_layout %}hero-landing--flip{% endif %}
         {% if section.settings.text_align_center_mobile %}hero-landing--center-mobile{% endif %}
         {% if section.settings.compact_spacing %}hero-landing--compact{% endif %}
         {% if section.settings.height_mode == 'px' %}hero-landing--height-px{% endif %}
         {% if section.settings.height_mode == 'vh' %}hero-landing--height-vh{% endif %}"
  style="
    --hero-overlay-color: {{ section.settings.overlay_color | color_to_rgb }};
    --hero-overlay-opacity: {{ section.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    {% if section.settings.bg_color != blank %}--hero-bg-color: {{ section.settings.bg_color }};{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.content_max_width != blank %}--hero-max-w: {{ section.settings.content_max_width }}px;{% endif %}
    --hero-pt: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    --hero-pb: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    /* Height controls */
    --hero-min-h-m: {{ section.settings.min_height_mobile }}px;
    --hero-min-h-d: {{ section.settings.min_height_desktop }}px;
    --hero-vh: {{ section.settings.vh_height }};
    --gap-sub-to-bullets: {{ section.settings.gap_sub_to_bullets }}px;
    --gap-between-bullets: {{ section.settings.gap_between_bullets }}px;

  "
  data-section-id="{{ section_id }}"
  data-hero
>
  {% comment %} Background (image or solid color) {% endcomment %}
<div class="hero-landing__bg" aria-hidden="true">
  {%- assign d = hero_d -%}
  {%- assign m = hero_m -%}

  {%- if d != blank or m != blank -%}
    <picture>
      {%- if d != blank -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          width/height are defence-in-depth for the shift described above: when
          this <source> is the chosen candidate the browser takes its aspect
          ratio from these attributes instead of falling back to the <img>'s
          mobile-portrait ones. Both current desktop heroes are 2400x1200, so
          this renders width="2400" height="1200" today; it is read off the
          image rather than hardcoded because hero_d can be overridden per
          product by the bundle.hero_desktop metafield above, and a hardcoded
          2:1 would then be wrong for that override.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <source
          media="(min-width: 768px)"
          srcset="{{ d | image_url: width: 2000 }} 2000w, {{ d | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ d | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w"
          sizes="100vw"
          width="{{ d.width }}"
          height="{{ d.height }}">
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if m != blank -%}
        <img
          alt=""
          class="hero-landing__bg-img"
          src="{{ m | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
          srcset="{{ m | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w, {{ m | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w, {{ m | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w"
          sizes="100vw"
          width="{{ m.width }}"
          height="{{ m.height }}"
          decoding="async"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high">
      {%- else -%}
        <img
          alt=""
          class="hero-landing__bg-img"
          src="{{ d | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
          srcset="{{ d | image_url: width: 2000 }} 2000w, {{ d | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ d | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w"
          sizes="100vw"
          width="{{ d.width }}"
          height="{{ d.height }}"
          decoding="async"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high">
      {%- endif -%}
    </picture>
    <div class="hero-landing__bg-overlay"></div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

  <div class="hero-landing__inner page-width" style="max-width: var(--hero-max-w, 1200px);">
    <div class="hero-landing__grid">
      <div class="hero-landing__content">

{%- liquid
  # Component-aggregate review data, written per product by scripts/sync-bundle-ratings.mjs.
  # A multipack inherits the reviews of the SKUs inside it — legitimate, and the caption
  # says so out loud. No data means no stars: never invent a rating for a product that
  # has none behind it.
  -%}




        {% assign heading_tag = section.settings.heading_level %}
        <{{ heading_tag }} class="hero-landing__heading rte">
          {{ hero_heading }}
        </{{ heading_tag }}>

        {% if hero_sub != blank %}
          <div class="hero-landing__subheading-wrap {% if section.settings.subheading_bg_image != blank %}hero-landing__subheading-wrap--bg{% endif %}"
               style="{% if section.settings.subheading_bg_image != blank %}--subhead-bg: url({{ section.settings.subheading_bg_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}); --subhead-bg-opacity: {{ section.settings.subheading_bg_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};{% endif %}">
            <div class="hero-landing__subheading rte">
              {{ hero_sub }}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {%- comment -%} Bullets {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign bullets = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'bullet' -%}
        {%- if bullets.size > 0 -%}
          <ul class="hero-landing__bullets {% if section.settings.bullets_center %}hero-landing__bullets--center{% endif %}" role="list">
            {%- for block in bullets -%}
              <li class="hero-landing__bullet" {{ block.shopify_attributes }} data-hero-bullet data-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
                <span class="hero-landing__bullet-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  {%- if block.settings.icon_source == 'preset' -%}
                    {%- render 'icon-hero', name: block.settings.icon_preset -%}
                  {%- elsif block.settings.icon_image != blank -%}
                    {{ block.settings.icon_image | image_url: width: 64 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- render 'icon-hero', name: 'check' -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
                {%- assign bullet_src = block.settings.text_rte -%}
                {%- if lander_bullets != blank and lander_bullets[forloop.index0] != blank -%}
                  {%- assign bullet_src = lander_bullets[forloop.index0] -%}
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="hero-landing__bullet-text rte">{{ bullet_src | replace: '[[TOTAL]]', bundle_total | replace: '[[PRICE]]', bundle_price | replace: '[[SAVINGS]]', bundle_savings }}</span>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        {%- endif -%}


        {% if hero_cta != blank %}
          <div class="hero-landing__cta">
            <a class="hero-landing__btn
                      {% if section.settings.cta_full_width_mobile %} hero-landing__btn--full-m{% endif %}
                      {% if section.settings.cta_full_width_desktop %} hero-landing__btn--full-d{% endif %}"
              href="{{ section.settings.cta_anchor | default: '#buy-box' }}"
              data-hero-cta>
              {{ hero_cta }}
            </a>
            {% if section.settings.secondary_cta_label != blank %}
              <a class="hero-landing__btn-secondary"
                href="{{ section.settings.secondary_cta_anchor | default: '#' }}">
                {{ section.settings.secondary_cta_label }}
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% comment %} Guarantees row (badges) {% endcomment %}
        {% assign guarantees = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'guarantee' %}
        {% if guarantees.size > 0 %}
          <div class="hero-landing__badges">
            {% for block in guarantees %}
              <div class="hero-landing__badge" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <span class="hero-landing__badge-icon">
                  {% if block.settings.icon_source == 'preset' %}
                    {% render 'icon-hero', name: block.settings.icon_preset %}
                  {% elsif block.settings.icon_image != blank %}
                    {{ block.settings.icon_image | image_url: width: 48 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
                  {% else %}
                    {% render 'icon-hero', name: 'badge' %}
                  {% endif %}
                </span>
                <span class="hero-landing__badge-text">{{ block.settings.text }}</span>
              </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% comment %}
        Optional side image slot (if you decide to add later).
        For now, hero is primarily background + content.
      {% endcomment %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {% comment %} basic smooth-scroll without global pollution {% endcomment %}
  <script>
  (function() {
    var root = document.getElementById('hero-landing-{{ section_id }}');
    if (!root) return;
    var cta = root.querySelector('[data-hero-cta]');
    if (!cta) return;
    cta.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
      var href = this.getAttribute('href') || '#buy-box';
      if (!href || href.charAt(0) !== '#') return;
      var target = document.querySelector(href);
      if (!target) return;
      e.preventDefault();
      var prefersReduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      try {
        target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: prefersReduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'start' });
      } catch (err) {
        window.location.hash = href;
      }
    });
  })();
</script>

</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Landing • Hero",
  "class": "section-landing-hero",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "select", "id": "heading_level", "label": "Heading level", "default": "h1", "options": [
      { "value": "h1", "label": "H1" }, { "value": "h2", "label": "H2" }
    ]},
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "heading_rte", "label": "Headline", "default": "<p>SAY GOODBYE TO YOUR BRAIN FOG</p>" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "subheading_rte", "label": "Subheadline", "default": "<p>DESIGNED FOR ALL-DAY CLARITY</p>" },

    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "subheading_bg_image", "label": "Subheadline background image (optional)" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "subheading_bg_opacity", "label": "Subheadline bg opacity", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 15 },

    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_rating", "label": "Show rating", "default": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "rating_value", "label": "Rating value (0–5)", "default": "4.9", "info": "Supports decimals (e.g., 4.9)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "rating_caption", "label": "Rating caption", "default": "Rated 4.9 by Real Customers" },

    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_label", "label": "CTA label", "default": "Unlock All-Day Clarity" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_anchor", "label": "CTA anchor (on-page id)", "default": "#buy-box" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secondary_cta_label", "label": "Secondary CTA label (text link, optional)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secondary_cta_anchor", "label": "Secondary CTA anchor / URL" },

    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "bg_image_desktop", "label": "Background image (desktop)" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "bg_image_mobile", "label": "Background image (mobile)" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "bg_color", "label": "Background color (fallback)", "default": "#eaf6ff" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "overlay_color", "label": "Overlay color", "default": "#000000" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "overlay_opacity", "label": "Overlay opacity", "min": 0, "max": 90, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 0 },

    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "flip_layout", "label": "Flip layout (text right on desktop)", "default": false },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "text_align_center_mobile", "label": "Center text on mobile", "default": true },
    { "type": "range", "id": "content_max_width", "label": "Max content width (px)", "min": 800, "max": 1400, "step": 20, "default": 1200 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_top", "label": "Padding top (px)", "min": 0, "max": 160, "step": 4, "default": 48 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_bottom", "label": "Padding bottom (px)", "min": 0, "max": 160, "step": 4, "default": 48 },

    { "type": "select", "id": "height_mode", "label": "Height behavior", "default": "auto", "options": [{ "value": "auto", "label": "Auto (content-driven)" }, { "value": "px", "label": "Fixed min height (px)" }, { "value": "vh", "label": "Viewport height (vh)" }]},
    { "type": "range", "id": "min_height_mobile", "label": "Min height (mobile, px)", "min": 320, "max": 720, "step": 20, "default": 480},
    { "type": "range", "id": "min_height_desktop", "label": "Min height (desktop, px)", "min": 420, "max": 900, "step": 20, "default": 600},
    { "type": "range", "id": "vh_height", "label": "Viewport height (vh)", "min": 50, "max": 90, "step": 1, "default": 70},
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "compact_spacing", "label": "Compact spacing", "default": true},

    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "cta_full_width_mobile", "label": "Make CTA full width on mobile", "default": true},
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "cta_full_width_desktop", "label": "Make CTA full width on desktop", "default": false},

    { "type": "range", "id": "gap_sub_to_bullets", "label": "Space between subheadline and bullets (px)", "min": 0, "max": 48, "step": 2, "default": 12},
    { "type": "range", "id": "gap_between_bullets", "label": "Space between each bullet (px)", "min": 0, "max": 28, "step": 2, "default": 10},
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "bullets_center", "label": "Center bullets (icon + text) horizontally", "default": false}
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "bullet",
      "name": "Bullet",
      "limit": 8,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "select", "id": "icon_source", "label": "Icon source", "default": "preset", "options": [
          { "value": "preset", "label": "Preset SVG" },
          { "value": "custom", "label": "Custom image" }
        ]},
        { "type": "select", "id": "icon_preset", "label": "Preset icon", "default": "check", "options": [
          { "value": "check", "label": "Check" },
          { "value": "star", "label": "Star" },
          { "value": "shield", "label": "Shield" },
          { "value": "truck", "label": "Truck" },
          { "value": "leaf", "label": "Leaf" },
          { "value": "clock", "label": "Clock" },
          { "value": "heart", "label": "Heart" },
          { "value": "badge", "label": "Badge" }
        ]},
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "icon_image", "label": "Custom icon (optional)" },
        { "type": "richtext", "id": "text_rte", "label": "Text", "default": "<p>Clean Energy, Zero Jitters</p>" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "guarantee",
      "name": "Guarantee badge",
      "limit": 6,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "select", "id": "icon_source", "label": "Icon source", "default": "preset", "options": [
          { "value": "preset", "label": "Preset SVG" },
          { "value": "custom", "label": "Custom image" }
        ]},
        { "type": "select", "id": "icon_preset", "label": "Preset icon", "default": "badge", "options": [
          { "value": "badge", "label": "Badge" },
          { "value": "truck", "label": "Truck" },
          { "value": "shield", "label": "Shield" },
          { "value": "leaf", "label": "Leaf" },
          { "value": "clock", "label": "Clock" },
          { "value": "heart", "label": "Heart" }
        ]},
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "icon_image", "label": "Custom icon (optional)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "Free Shipping" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Landing • Hero",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "bullet" },
        { "type": "bullet" },
        { "type": "bullet" },
        { "type": "guarantee" },
        { "type": "guarantee" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}

